{
  "name": "🚨 Haunting Alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "bughunter-hunt",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "authentication": "headerAuth"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Bug Hunter Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "bughunter-hunt",
      "credentials": {
        "headerAuth": {
          "id": null,
          "name": "BugHunter Header Auth — REPLACE ME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000201",
              "name": "creature_label",
              "value": "={{ $json.haunting_level === 'possessed' ? '💀 Possessed' : $json.haunting_level === 'haunted' ? '👻 Haunted' : $json.haunting_level === 'restless' ? '🦇 Restless' : $json.haunting_level === 'whispers' ? '🕯️ Whispers' : '🌕 Clear' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000202",
              "name": "total_spirits",
              "value": "={{ ($json.counts.critical || 0) + ($json.counts.high || 0) + ($json.counts.medium || 0) + ($json.counts.low || 0) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000203",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $json.finished_at ? new Date($json.finished_at).toLocaleString() : new Date().toISOString() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Normalize Hunt Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        80,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000301",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.repo }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": false
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000302",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.pr_number }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Valid Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        360,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Stop Invalid Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000501",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.haunting_level }}",
              "rightValue": "haunted",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals",
                "singleValue": false
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000502",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.haunting_level }}",
              "rightValue": "possessed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals",
                "singleValue": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Haunted or Possessed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        620,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "No Alert Needed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📌 INSERT HERE: Google Sheets → Append\n\nAdd a **Google Sheets** node between \"Valid Payload\" (true branch) and \"Haunted or Possessed\":\n\n- Resource: **Sheet**\n- Operation: **Append Row** (\"Append\")\n- Spreadsheet: your Hunt Ledger spreadsheet\n- Sheet: **Hunt Ledger**\n- Columns (12, in order): time, repo, PR #, title, haunting level, demons, ghosts, bats, cobwebs, possession attempt, false alarms exorcised, PR link\n\nFull config in **IMPORT.md → Workflow 1 → Google Sheets Append**.\nTurn **Continue on Fail** ON.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "INSERT Google Sheets Append",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📌 INSERT HERE: Gmail → Send\n\nAdd a **Gmail** node on the 🟢 TRUE branch of \"Haunted or Possessed\":\n\n- Resource: **Message**\n- Operation: **Send**\n- To: maintainer address\n- Subject: `🎃 Bug Hunter: PR #{{ pr_number }} is {{ haunting_level }}`\n- Email type: HTML\n- Body: haunting level + top findings + PR link (+ possession line when `possession_attempt` is true)\n\nFull config in **IMPORT.md → Workflow 1 → Gmail Send**.\nTurn **Continue on Fail** ON.\nOptional: also add **Discord** or **Slack** here.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "INSERT Gmail Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Bug Hunter Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Normalize Hunt Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Normalize Hunt Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Valid Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Valid Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Haunted or Possessed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Stop Invalid Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Haunted or Possessed": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "No Alert Needed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {}
}
